entries[324128] = { ["name"] = "Death's Due", ["text"] = "Covenant Ability\n1 Rune / -10 Runic Power 30 yd range\nInstant 30 sec cooldown\n1 Charge\nCorrupts the targeted ground, causing [(5.4054% of Attack Power) * 11] Shadow damage over 10 sec to targets within the area.\n\nBlood, Unholy\nWhile you remain within the area, your [Necrotic Strike and] [ Blood : Heart Strike will hit up to 0 additional targets and inflict Death's Due for 12 sec ][Scourge Strike will hit up to 7 enemies near the target and inflict Death's Due for 12 sec.] [\nWhile you remain within the area, your Obliterate will hit up to 1 additional target and inflict Death's Due for 12 sec.]\nDeath's Due reduces damage enemies deal to you by 2%, up to a maximum of 8% and their power is transferred to you as an equal amount of Strength." }
