entries[324195] = { ["name"] = "Missive of Versatility", ["text"] = "3.5 sec cast\nTools: Virtuoso Inking Set\nReagents:\nLuminous Ink (2), Umbral Ink (8), Tranquil Ink , Dark Parchment\nCraft a Missive of Versatility, an Optional Reagent that guarantees a crafted weapon or armor will have Versatility as a stat.\nProfession:\nShadowlands Inscription (40)\nTrainer:\nScribe Au'tehshi\nZone:\nOribos\nCost:\n1\n50\n\nOptional Crafting Reagent\n\nProvides the following property: Guarantee Versatility\nUsable with: Shadowlands recipes for Rare and Legendary armor and accessories.\n\"Crafted by scribes, Missives can be bought and sold on the Auction House.\"" }
